entries[30558] = { ["name"] = "The Bigger One", ["text"] = "25 sec cast\nTools: Blacksmith Hammer , Arclight Spanner\nReagents:\nFel Iron Casing (3), Elemental Blasting Powder (6), Arcane Powder (3), Handful of Fel Iron Bolts (2)\n(3)\nRequires Engineering\n(325)\n\nUse: Inflicts 600 to 1000 Fire damage and incapacitates targets for 5 sec in a 10 yard radius. Any damage will break the effect. Unreliable against targets higher than level 80. (1 Min Cooldown)" }
